  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Push Th' Little Daisies** (1 other source): The cassette was flipped during the applause following this song [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Chat**: back after 114 archived shows (816 days); rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Exactly Where I Am**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **The Rainbow**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2001-03-27.Cassettemaster.16bit48kHz** (recommended): source not stated; 38 songs; 174 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Chant [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2001-03-27.Cassettemaster.16bit48kHz**: taped by Steve Hanna; transferred by Steve Hanna & Dennis Orr; source: Sony WM-D6C with supplied mic > Master Cassettes (2 x Maxell XLII) [1]. Also: Transferred from the master cassettes via Sony WM-D6C to a Sony PCM-M10 at 16 bit/48 kHz, then restored with iZotope RX9 de-click and Sound Forge [1]",
